  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation interface: it senses obstacles (front, left, right) and path clearance, and can execute move_forward or rotate_clockwise. The specification enforces safe exploration: move_forward is only enabled when clear, and rotate_clockwise is the only recovery action for any obstacle. After recovery, the supervisor returns to exploration as soon as the path is clear. All obstacle events preempt forward motion, and only one controllable is enabled per state. The design is deterministic, safe, and strongly biased toward forward progress.",
